{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-FS.md","title":"Friedman-Sheard理论","display":"df-FS — Friedman-Sheard理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-FS","aliases":["91-df-FS","91-df-friedman-sheard"],"display":"df-FS — Friedman-Sheard理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","[[91-df-release-axiom]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-FS"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-FS</span><span>91-df-friedman-sheard</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-FS — Friedman-Sheard理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52e708105e8ce779\" href=\"?note=52e708105e8ce779\" title=\"91-df-untyped-truth\">91-df-untyped-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" href=\"?note=7dc6a6fb8ddfca30\" title=\"91-df-capture-axiom\">91-df-capture-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"efd61e76586d57ab\" href=\"?note=efd61e76586d57ab\" title=\"91-df-release-axiom\">91-df-release-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-FS-—-Friedman-Sheard理论-$\\mathrm{FS}$\">df-FS — Friedman-Sheard理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano算术, primitive)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (扩展语言闭项集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (至多以指定变量自由的扩展语言公式集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\\)</span> (捕获规避的数字代入编码函数,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 是下述定义的 FS 组合公理集；句子、闭项与单自由变量公式均取上述扩展语言实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\varphi}{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})},\n\\frac{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}{\\varphi}\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\varphi}{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})},\n\\frac{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}{\\varphi}\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow(s=t),\\\\\n&amp;T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\n&amp;T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})),\\\\\n&amp;T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\theta\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n))\n\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow(s=t),\\\\\n&amp;T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\n&amp;T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})),\\\\\n&amp;T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\theta\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n))\n\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\cup\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FS}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\cup\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取与存在量词子句由这里的经典否定、合取和全称子句定义性导出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> : Friedman-Sheard理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\)</span>：保留经典否定的型自由组合公理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\)</span>：从定理到其真理断言、以及反向释放的两条规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：FS 是经典背景逻辑中的无类型真理理论。其关键特征是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>经典组合否定</strong>：保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\neg\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\varphi)\">\\(T(\\neg\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\varphi)\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>受控真理迭代</strong>：不用与否定公理不相容的全局真理迭代双条件，而采用捕获/释放规则</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致性</strong>：标准 FS 语法一致且算术后果正确，但为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致</li>\n</ol>\n<p>FS 的精确算术强度需要相对于所选基础理论、归纳模式与分层真理版本\n单独校准，不能仅由名称与 KF 作无条件排序。标准 FS 语法上一致但\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致，所以没有标准自然数模型；其一致性应通过相应的\n证明论约化或非标准模型论证，而不是假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-FS-—-Friedman-Sheard理论-$\\mathrm{FS}$","text":"df-FS — Friedman-Sheard理论 $\\mathrm{FS}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-untyped-truth","status":"resolved","id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-capture-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-release-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"efd61e76586d57ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-release-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T$ (扩展语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","h